# Raw & processed data are NOT committed:
#  - SILSO sunspot data is CC BY-NC (redistribution should carry attribution)
#  - files are large (daily sunspots ~3 MB) and fully regenerable
# Provenance lives in data/raw/MANIFEST.md (tracked); run src/fetch_data.py to rebuild.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/MANIFEST.md
!data/raw/README.md
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/processed/README.md

# Derived analysis outputs (regenerable by R/correlate.R)
results/*
!results/README.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# R
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
